  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e27e92ea3e7b49858f7fbe3e72e8733, type: 2}
    text: An old man and woman scammed my house away!
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e27e92ea3e7b49858f7fbe3e72e8733, type: 2}
    text: Now they divorced and the house is gone.. hahaha
